# UROP — repository ignore rules
#
# Scope note: artifacts/stage2/ and artifacts/stage3/ are deliberately NOT
# blanket-ignored. Small provenance manifests, metrics and experiment records
# under them are intentional project work and must stay trackable. Only the
# specific large or regenerable files named below are excluded.

# --- Dataset -----------------------------------------------------------------
# The image corpus and the label metadata are governed by a research-use
# agreement. They are never redistributed through this repository.
data/
train_cheXbert.csv
train_visualCheXbert.csv

# --- Checkpoints and partial writes ------------------------------------------
# Model weights are hundreds of MB each and are reproducible from the manifests
# that ARE tracked. *.tmp catches the partial file an interrupted atomic write
# leaves behind.
*.pt
*.pth
*.tmp

# --- Python / local environment ----------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.env
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# --- Local agent / editor state ----------------------------------------------
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Logs ---------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log

# --- Known large or regenerable reports ---------------------------------------
# Both are outputs of scripts in src/data/ and can be regenerated on demand.
# duplicates_near_crosspatient.csv is ~540 MB, which exceeds GitHub's 100 MB
# per-file limit outright.
artifacts/stage2/reports/duplicates_near_crosspatient.csv
artifacts/stage2/reports/image_validation_full.csv

# --- Fixture / dry-run experiment directories ---------------------------------
# Synthetic smoke-test runs. Never real experiments, and some embed local
# temp-directory paths.
artifacts/stage3/runs/FIXTURE__*/

# --- OS noise -----------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
